{'symbol': 'GE', 'date': '2023-01-04 06:21:00', 'title': 'GE COMPLETES SEPARATION OF GE HEALTHCARE', 'text': 'BOSTON--( BUSINESS WIRE )--GE (NYSE: GE) ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS COMPLETED THE SEPARATION OF ITS HEALTHCARE BUSINESS, LAUNCHING GE HEALTHCARE TECHNOLOGIES INC. (“GE HEALTHCARE”), A GLOBAL LEADER IN PRECISION CARE. STARTING TODAY, JANUARY 4, 2023, GE HEALTHCARE WILL TRADE ON NASDAQ UNDER THE TICKER SYMBOL “GEHC”.'}